### Sample requests. Usable with the IntelliJ/VS Code REST client, or read as
### documentation. Change @host if you started dev mode on another port.

@host = http://localhost:8080

### Add the real Hacker News front page feed
POST {{host}}/feeds
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "hn", "url": "https://hn.algolia.com/api/v1/search?tags=front_page"}

### Add a feed that will fail, to see partial failure handling
POST {{host}}/feeds
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "broken", "url": "https://hn.algolia.com/api/v1/not-a-real-endpoint"}

### Rejected: scheme must be http or https
POST {{host}}/feeds
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "ftp feed", "url": "ftp://example.com/feed"}

### Rejected: name must not be blank
POST {{host}}/feeds
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "   ", "url": "https://example.com/feed"}

### Rejected: url must be absolute
POST {{host}}/feeds
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "relative", "url": "not-a-url"}

### List feeds. Watch lastFetchedAt, lastAttemptedAt and lastError.
GET {{host}}/feeds

### Fetch now. Run this twice: the second reports created 0, updated N.
POST {{host}}/refresh

### All items, newest first
GET {{host}}/items

### Case-insensitive title search
GET {{host}}/items?q=ai

### Search within one feed
GET {{host}}/items?q=ai&feedId=1

### Page 1 and page 2. Every item appears exactly once across them.
GET {{host}}/items?limit=2&offset=0

###
GET {{host}}/items?limit=2&offset=2

### limit is clamped to 100
GET {{host}}/items?limit=5000

### 400: offset must not be negative
GET {{host}}/items?offset=-1

### 400: limit must be at least 1
GET {{host}}/items?limit=0

### Delete a feed. Its items go with it. 404 if unknown.
DELETE {{host}}/feeds/1
